{
  "id": "ignore-generated",
  "kind": "terminal",
  "language": "git",
  "title": {
    "tr": "Üretilen ve gizli dosyalar",
    "en": "Generated and secret files"
  },
  "difficulty": 2,
  "prompt": {
    "tr": "prompt.tr.md",
    "en": "prompt.en.md"
  },
  "setup": [
    "mkdir app",
    "cd app",
    "git init",
    "echo \"print(1)\" > app.py",
    "echo \"API_KEY=secret\" > .env",
    "mkdir build",
    "echo \"bin\" > build/app.exe",
    "mkdir -p src/__pycache__",
    "echo \"x = 1\" > src/util.py",
    "echo \"pyc\" > src/__pycache__/util.cpython-314.pyc"
  ],
  "cwd": "app",
  "solution": [
    "echo \"build/\" > .gitignore",
    "echo \"__pycache__/\" >> .gitignore",
    "echo \".env\" >> .gitignore",
    "git status -s",
    "git add .",
    "git commit -m \"Ignore generated files\""
  ],
  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "İlk satır `>` ile, sonrakiler `>>` ile. Sonu `/` olan desen yalnızca klasörlere uyar.",
      "en": "First line with `>`, the rest with `>>`. A pattern ending in `/` matches folders only."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı (komutları sırayla yaz):\n\n```bash\necho \"build/\" > .gitignore\necho \"__pycache__/\" >> .gitignore\necho \".env\" >> .gitignore\ngit status -s\ngit add .\ngit commit -m \"Ignore generated files\"\n```",
      "en": "The full solution (type the commands in order):\n\n```bash\necho \"build/\" > .gitignore\necho \"__pycache__/\" >> .gitignore\necho \".env\" >> .gitignore\ngit status -s\ngit add .\ngit commit -m \"Ignore generated files\"\n```"
    }
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "type": "git_state",
      "repo": "app",
      "ignored": [
        "build/app.exe",
        "src/__pycache__/util.cpython-314.pyc",
        ".env"
      ],
      "label": {
        "tr": "build, __pycache__ ve .env görmezden geliniyor",
        "en": "build, __pycache__ and .env are ignored"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "git_state",
      "repo": "app",
      "head_files": {
        "app.py": null,
        "src/util.py": null,
        ".gitignore": null
      },
      "label": {
        "tr": "Kod ve .gitignore commit'te",
        "en": "The code and .gitignore are committed"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "git_state",
      "repo": "app",
      "clean": true,
      "last_message": "^Ignore generated files$",
      "show_message": "Ignore generated files",
      "label": {
        "tr": "Ağaç temiz",
        "en": "Tree clean"
      }
    }
  ]
}
